    "detailed_description": "<h1>Last Demo Update 22-Aug-2024.</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1360210/extras/2a34adffbc28370f254c97183aa8a840.avif?t=1729970519\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">If you found a bug or the the demo was too hard in the easy mode, it should be resolved by now :)</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Remember that you can replay the demo with a funny language translation, just start in \"Advanced mode\" is the option right at the start of the game</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">(If there still is any problem or something you recommend to change in the demo or page, you can use \"bug report\" in this store page)</h2></p><br><h1>Hear the Soundtrack, you will be surprised!</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1360210/extras/37aa7cf903d5586e2e02b9bbb1c48a41.avif?t=1729970519\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You can hear the Soundtrack and Wishlist if you like it</h2></p><br><h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1360210/extras/65328d836223da9716afab5420717766.avif?t=1729970519\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1360210/extras/2132d2c70ce99d972e4140a360d4da7b.webp?t=1729970519\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1360210/extras/0b76123299aa800e61dd7be78b1be933.webp?t=1729970519\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1360210/extras/7db144e57599e3ff3aeb6cfc2834d599.avif?t=1729970519\" /></div> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1360210/extras/da69a978014d7ace3267388315619e01.poster.avif?t=1729970519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1360210/extras/da69a978014d7ace3267388315619e01.webm?t=1729970519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1360210/extras/da69a978014d7ace3267388315619e01.mp4?t=1729970519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>JRPG turn-based battles alternate with a deep and realistic storyline that will keep you on the edge of your seat and make you contemplate near-future world problems and challenges.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play free the start of the game in the Demo</h2></strong></li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1360210/extras/1c19dd68376531b1350a78d460586f61.poster.avif?t=1729970519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1360210/extras/1c19dd68376531b1350a78d460586f61.webm?t=1729970519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1360210/extras/1c19dd68376531b1350a78d460586f61.mp4?t=1729970519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Get ready for an adventure set in our near future! The game is fully illustrated with over 1000 images and poses, and it features original music created by the game\u2019s developer and from other great artists (including a Miku composer).<br><br>Explore both the virtual world inside computers and a dystopian dark future in the real world, with each situation and dialogue carrying depth and meaning.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay, menus and turn-based combat similar to FF 6 game</h2></strong></li></ul> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Romance and universe feel similar to Atry game and Anime</h2></strong></li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1360210/extras/65328d836223da9716afab5420717766.avif?t=1729970519\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1360210/extras/3bd192a1a1b72e165b2f072ffd290ccf.poster.avif?t=1729970519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1360210/extras/3bd192a1a1b72e165b2f072ffd290ccf.webm?t=1729970519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1360210/extras/6c4d7bca90a2c85c241f9ac69f838da7.avif?t=1729970519\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1360210/extras/17c84596848a977fa4606fe19c84e18d.poster.avif?t=1729970519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1360210/extras/17c84596848a977fa4606fe19c84e18d.webm?t=1729970519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1360210/extras/17c84596848a977fa4606fe19c84e18d.mp4?t=1729970519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1360210/extras/1fe19450bddc455a502ec069e1dd43f1.avif?t=1729970519\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1360210/extras/546c241bc2e41c03646aa2a237a7e1fb.avif?t=1729970519